SwHothTundra_Text_SwRebelSurveyor_1:
	.string "“Major Derlin. One of my scouts walked\n"
	.string "north and did not walk back. Find him\p"
	.string "and the general will hear of it.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwTauntaunHandler_1:
	.string "“They smell worse inside than out. Still\n"
	.string "beats walking.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwIceTrekker1_1:
	.string "“Cal Alder. Survey team. The cold keeps\n"
	.string "you honest.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwIceTrekker2_1:
	.string "“Toryn Farr. If the general picks this\n"
	.string "rock for a base, I want a transfer.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwIceTrekker3_1:
	.string "“Tigran Jamiro. There is something in\n"
	.string "the cave with claws. We named it after\p"
	.string "the scream it makes.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwLostScout_1:
	.string "“...I saw it. White. Tall. I am not going\n"
	.string "back in there. Take this; I will not need\p"
	.string "ice to remember.”$"

SwHothTundra_Text_SwOutpostSign1_1:
